{"4533490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"黯渊崛起：魔灵深渊","steam_appid":4533490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4813890],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款RPG刷宝冒险游戏，内容丰富，多职业多次转职和觉醒成长、门派势力选择、宠物培养、宝石镶嵌——构建专属的深渊冒险。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/c455dd19b1ae9e4f6abe8b4e954a0ddd.avif?t=1789371644\" width=1088 height=590 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >几百种装备和独特道具自由搭配自由冒险，数百种技能机制各异玩法丰富，大量新的冒险地图等你来探索。<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/331ad9b7d384224bc4a6d6f17589f17c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/331ad9b7d384224bc4a6d6f17589f17c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大量新创作的地图，冰天雪地，岩浆，森林，遗迹，墓园等<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/ff2112b899e16c5d9a9b3ba43bf3988e.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/ff2112b899e16c5d9a9b3ba43bf3988e.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【游戏特色】<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.技能机制各异玩法丰富<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数百种专门开发的技能：主动\/被动\/召唤\/变身大Boss\/属性光环\/阵法\/自爆\/盗宝等多种多样的技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >华丽的技能特效，实实在在的打击感<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过技能熟练度可以增加伤害甚至进化技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >盗宝技能可以多次触发物品和金币掉落，再也没有难掉落的装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/28aaadfc31b0088d96fc76a0e6e2097c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/28aaadfc31b0088d96fc76a0e6e2097c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >甚至可以召唤任何强大的Boss敌人为你而战，不仅仅是敌人，复制队友，释放分身，让战斗不再枯燥无味<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >敌人和我方都会学习觉醒技能，通过积累怒气释放<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/4b3ff3968a8e3c49e5dbe4779efc4f2a.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/4b3ff3968a8e3c49e5dbe4779efc4f2a.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.<strong>多阶职业转职系统<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从基础职业，转职到中阶职业，再到高阶职业，最终进行觉醒，每一步都能实实在在提高角色的实力<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >还有一些强大的特殊职业等待发现<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基础职业包括：异界人\/战士\/僧侣\/士兵\/猎人\/魔法师等，有着不同的转职路线不同的装备类型<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/66f95aa4f9f175ce9eec450e7850b5c1.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/66f95aa4f9f175ce9eec450e7850b5c1.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.海量装备自由搭配<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数百种装备，套装收集，装备技能提取，宠物魔变装备，随机强化，镶嵌，宝石合成等<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刷怪收集套装获得强大的套装属性<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >独立的稀有装备有特殊的技能，可以变身强大的boss，华丽的元素光环，签订契约召唤敌人等<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武器装备模式多样化，9大类武器，可以使用剑盾模式，二刀流，双手持的不同装备，在防御和输出之间取舍<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4.<strong>深度角色成长<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色拥有多职业转职路线，每一条路线都有精心设计的技能和对应的打法<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武器熟练度养成，通过不断使用武器和武器技能能够提高武器的熟练度，从而提高伤害和学会新的武器技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >技能熟练度培养<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/cccb2eeb73d1e526eaef58c4a928d846.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/cccb2eeb73d1e526eaef58c4a928d846.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5.宠物系统<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物同样可以从初阶进化到中阶，高阶，每一只宠物都是独一无二的<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物捕获\/进化\/孵化可以获得大量的随机主动和被动技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物有几率获得【变异】甚至非常稀有的【魔变】<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物的合成和部位突变玩法非常灵活，可以培养出拥有大量装备部位的强大个体，攻守兼备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔变的强大宠物培养之后可以转化成为魔变装备，拥有非常强大的属性和套装效果<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6.门派系统<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏分为五毒教、忍宗、魔法研究院、圣母神教会四个门派可以自由选择<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不同门派拥有不同的技能和商店道具以及不同的玩法<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >五毒教：用毒，造成异常状态，召唤傀儡辅助战斗<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >忍宗：分身术，复制敌人，手里剑<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔法研究院：增强四元素魔法攻防，学习四元素顶级华丽技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >圣母神教会：光暗魔法，变身，封印敌人变身和光环<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过门派任务获得报酬提升门派等级，解锁更多商店和技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7.<strong>世界Boss与副本挑战<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打败实力强大的世界Boss和副本Boss可以获得稀有的装备\/技能书\/道具<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索不同副本的解锁机制，挑战更高难度的副本，增强掉落装备属性<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >副本难度越高，敌人属性越高，技能越多，掉落装备属性增强，掉宝率\/经验值\/金币获得增加<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地狱难度的副本会出现新姿态的最终Boss，掉落更稀有的道具和装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/1e90942d15e693325fa8aaa9d67950dc.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/1e90942d15e693325fa8aaa9d67950dc.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/0a00019e19f3b7d15a5cd3c576948333.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/0a00019e19f3b7d15a5cd3c576948333.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8.随机事件<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【宠物秘境】会随机出现，可以捕获大量宠物，提高获得变异魔变宠物的机会，挑战boss和魔王获得进化道具<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【门派通缉令】击杀敌对门派势力Boss，掉落稀有物品和技能书，获得大量门派贡献<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【宝箱怪】掉落宝石，大量经验和金币等，捕获宝箱怪培养成为强大的魔王甚至可以成为队伍主力<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【武道会竞技】和各大门派的高手对决，有几率掉落各种珍稀道具和装备，体验4大门派独一无二的技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9.强大独特的敌人<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种多样的副本Boss和世界Boss<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >变异和突变的敌人拥有更强大的属性，同时也有更高的报酬<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10.详细的图鉴功能<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【怪物图鉴】查询怪物技能，掉落和属性弱点等详细的数据<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/60ed90c648877db7cb6e971aad81966d.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/60ed90c648877db7cb6e971aad81966d.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【宠物图鉴】查看宠物捕获和进化过程中可以获得的所有技能组和专属技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【怪物雷达】显示当前地图的所有怪物和出现概率<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【技能图鉴】查看所有在战斗中使用过的技能详情，让战斗更加有针对性<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/b71947b08382471f1379cc920029486c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/b71947b08382471f1379cc920029486c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【状态图鉴】清楚看到每个状态的具体作用和时长<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11.天气系统<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中有多种不同的天气，提供不同的元素和属性加成，部分技能可以改变天气<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >还分为白天和黑夜，部分地图事件和特殊敌人在夜间出现，掉落更稀有的装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>〖 开发者寄语 〗<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>目前大多数功能已经实现，但由于工作量较大，剩余部分还在加速开发中<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >正在实现的功能：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.剧情：更多的主线任务，更多的支线任务以及门派任务<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.更多职业：后续会开发更多特殊职业，比如<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>魔剑士<\/strong>（暗属性吸血技能，魔法和物理双修）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>死灵术士<\/strong>（封印死亡敌人召唤为我军战斗单位）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>剑圣<\/strong>（三刀流装备3把武器，更强大的剑术技能）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>驱魔师<\/strong>（召唤敌人，强化召唤物，大量召唤）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为二次转职增加更多分支选择<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.世界Boss：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掉落各种特殊装备和道具，增强队伍实力<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物魔化，突破等级，选择物攻\/法攻\/护卫\/治疗不同形态<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.新地图：70级以上地图和怪物，更多强大且具备特色的装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.新的功能：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无限增强的爬塔模式，怪物和掉落装备都会一直增强<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款RPG刷宝冒险游戏，内容丰富，多职业多次转职和觉醒成长、门派势力选择、宠物培养、宝石镶嵌——构建专属的深渊冒险。<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/c455dd19b1ae9e4f6abe8b4e954a0ddd.avif?t=1789371644\" width=1088 height=590 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >几百种装备和独特道具自由搭配自由冒险，数百种技能机制各异玩法丰富，大量新的冒险地图等你来探索。<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/331ad9b7d384224bc4a6d6f17589f17c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/331ad9b7d384224bc4a6d6f17589f17c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大量新创作的地图，冰天雪地，岩浆，森林，遗迹，墓园等<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/ff2112b899e16c5d9a9b3ba43bf3988e.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/ff2112b899e16c5d9a9b3ba43bf3988e.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【游戏特色】<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1.技能机制各异玩法丰富<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数百种专门开发的技能：主动\/被动\/召唤\/变身大Boss\/属性光环\/阵法\/自爆\/盗宝等多种多样的技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >华丽的技能特效，实实在在的打击感<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过技能熟练度可以增加伤害甚至进化技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >盗宝技能可以多次触发物品和金币掉落，再也没有难掉落的装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/28aaadfc31b0088d96fc76a0e6e2097c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/28aaadfc31b0088d96fc76a0e6e2097c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >甚至可以召唤任何强大的Boss敌人为你而战，不仅仅是敌人，复制队友，释放分身，让战斗不再枯燥无味<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >敌人和我方都会学习觉醒技能，通过积累怒气释放<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/4b3ff3968a8e3c49e5dbe4779efc4f2a.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/4b3ff3968a8e3c49e5dbe4779efc4f2a.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.<strong>多阶职业转职系统<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >从基础职业，转职到中阶职业，再到高阶职业，最终进行觉醒，每一步都能实实在在提高角色的实力<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >还有一些强大的特殊职业等待发现<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >基础职业包括：异界人\/战士\/僧侣\/士兵\/猎人\/魔法师等，有着不同的转职路线不同的装备类型<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/66f95aa4f9f175ce9eec450e7850b5c1.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/66f95aa4f9f175ce9eec450e7850b5c1.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3.海量装备自由搭配<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数百种装备，套装收集，装备技能提取，宠物魔变装备，随机强化，镶嵌，宝石合成等<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >刷怪收集套装获得强大的套装属性<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >独立的稀有装备有特殊的技能，可以变身强大的boss，华丽的元素光环，签订契约召唤敌人等<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武器装备模式多样化，9大类武器，可以使用剑盾模式，二刀流，双手持的不同装备，在防御和输出之间取舍<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4.<strong>深度角色成长<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >角色拥有多职业转职路线，每一条路线都有精心设计的技能和对应的打法<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >武器熟练度养成，通过不断使用武器和武器技能能够提高武器的熟练度，从而提高伤害和学会新的武器技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >技能熟练度培养<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/cccb2eeb73d1e526eaef58c4a928d846.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/cccb2eeb73d1e526eaef58c4a928d846.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5.宠物系统<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物同样可以从初阶进化到中阶，高阶，每一只宠物都是独一无二的<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物捕获\/进化\/孵化可以获得大量的随机主动和被动技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物有几率获得【变异】甚至非常稀有的【魔变】<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物的合成和部位突变玩法非常灵活，可以培养出拥有大量装备部位的强大个体，攻守兼备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔变的强大宠物培养之后可以转化成为魔变装备，拥有非常强大的属性和套装效果<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6.门派系统<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏分为五毒教、忍宗、魔法研究院、圣母神教会四个门派可以自由选择<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不同门派拥有不同的技能和商店道具以及不同的玩法<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >五毒教：用毒，造成异常状态，召唤傀儡辅助战斗<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >忍宗：分身术，复制敌人，手里剑<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >魔法研究院：增强四元素魔法攻防，学习四元素顶级华丽技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >圣母神教会：光暗魔法，变身，封印敌人变身和光环<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过门派任务获得报酬提升门派等级，解锁更多商店和技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7.<strong>世界Boss与副本挑战<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >打败实力强大的世界Boss和副本Boss可以获得稀有的装备\/技能书\/道具<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >探索不同副本的解锁机制，挑战更高难度的副本，增强掉落装备属性<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >副本难度越高，敌人属性越高，技能越多，掉落装备属性增强，掉宝率\/经验值\/金币获得增加<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地狱难度的副本会出现新姿态的最终Boss，掉落更稀有的道具和装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/1e90942d15e693325fa8aaa9d67950dc.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/1e90942d15e693325fa8aaa9d67950dc.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/0a00019e19f3b7d15a5cd3c576948333.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/0a00019e19f3b7d15a5cd3c576948333.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8.随机事件<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【宠物秘境】会随机出现，可以捕获大量宠物，提高获得变异魔变宠物的机会，挑战boss和魔王获得进化道具<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【门派通缉令】击杀敌对门派势力Boss，掉落稀有物品和技能书，获得大量门派贡献<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【宝箱怪】掉落宝石，大量经验和金币等，捕获宝箱怪培养成为强大的魔王甚至可以成为队伍主力<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【武道会竞技】和各大门派的高手对决，有几率掉落各种珍稀道具和装备，体验4大门派独一无二的技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>9.强大独特的敌人<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种多样的副本Boss和世界Boss<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >变异和突变的敌人拥有更强大的属性，同时也有更高的报酬<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10.详细的图鉴功能<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【怪物图鉴】查询怪物技能，掉落和属性弱点等详细的数据<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/60ed90c648877db7cb6e971aad81966d.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/60ed90c648877db7cb6e971aad81966d.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【宠物图鉴】查看宠物捕获和进化过程中可以获得的所有技能组和专属技能<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/cd705591a9c5ab1caa501a28b99d163c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【怪物雷达】显示当前地图的所有怪物和出现概率<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【技能图鉴】查看所有在战斗中使用过的技能详情，让战斗更加有针对性<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras\/b71947b08382471f1379cc920029486c.avif?t=1789371644\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/extras_big\/b71947b08382471f1379cc920029486c.avif?t=1789371644 width=1560 height=834 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【状态图鉴】清楚看到每个状态的具体作用和时长<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11.天气系统<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中有多种不同的天气，提供不同的元素和属性加成，部分技能可以改变天气<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >还分为白天和黑夜，部分地图事件和特殊敌人在夜间出现，掉落更稀有的装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>〖 开发者寄语 〗<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>目前大多数功能已经实现，但由于工作量较大，剩余部分还在加速开发中<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >正在实现的功能：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.剧情：更多的主线任务，更多的支线任务以及门派任务<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.更多职业：后续会开发更多特殊职业，比如<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>魔剑士<\/strong>（暗属性吸血技能，魔法和物理双修）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>死灵术士<\/strong>（封印死亡敌人召唤为我军战斗单位）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>剑圣<\/strong>（三刀流装备3把武器，更强大的剑术技能）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>驱魔师<\/strong>（召唤敌人，强化召唤物，大量召唤）<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为二次转职增加更多分支选择<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.世界Boss：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掉落各种特殊装备和道具，增强队伍实力<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宠物魔化，突破等级，选择物攻\/法攻\/护卫\/治疗不同形态<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.新地图：70级以上地图和怪物，更多强大且具备特色的装备<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.新的功能：<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无限增强的爬塔模式，怪物和掉落装备都会一直增强<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"这是一款RPG刷宝冒险游戏，内容丰富，多职业多次转职和觉醒成长、门派势力选择、宠物进化培养、宝石镶嵌——构建专属的深渊冒险。 几百种装备和独特道具自由搭配自由冒险，数百种技能机制各异玩法丰富，大量新的冒险地图等你来探索。","supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/0b1e0bca3a7b1bb2c1ea0483d7904079047a5d02\/header.jpg?t=1789371644","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/c10f12b7b55739523ff113f098e7f4e2720bfffe\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789371644","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/c10f12b7b55739523ff113f098e7f4e2720bfffe\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1789371644","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2048 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 9.0c<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> <\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> <br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> <\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["攸缘游戏"],"publishers":["攸缘游戏"],"demos":[{"appid":4813890,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":730,"final":730,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$7.30"},"packages":[1581001],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy 黯渊崛起：魔灵深渊","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1581001,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"暗渊崛起 - $7.30","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":730}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"3","description":"RPG"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/288d74614df5312e92bee0fef30c407db05a83dc\/ss_288d74614df5312e92bee0fef30c407db05a83dc.600x338.jpg?t=1789371644","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/288d74614df5312e92bee0fef30c407db05a83dc\/ss_288d74614df5312e92bee0fef30c407db05a83dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789371644"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/5424ab49b60036e414accf8e9f95101f7155c4ac\/ss_5424ab49b60036e414accf8e9f95101f7155c4ac.600x338.jpg?t=1789371644","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/5424ab49b60036e414accf8e9f95101f7155c4ac\/ss_5424ab49b60036e414accf8e9f95101f7155c4ac.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789371644"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/d8715d197ad25bd1d09cf86caac64c746f749fca\/ss_d8715d197ad25bd1d09cf86caac64c746f749fca.600x338.jpg?t=1789371644","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/d8715d197ad25bd1d09cf86caac64c746f749fca\/ss_d8715d197ad25bd1d09cf86caac64c746f749fca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789371644"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/05f9a30395428c07f4e7078b0cdce23da3dd0997\/ss_05f9a30395428c07f4e7078b0cdce23da3dd0997.600x338.jpg?t=1789371644","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/05f9a30395428c07f4e7078b0cdce23da3dd0997\/ss_05f9a30395428c07f4e7078b0cdce23da3dd0997.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789371644"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/9dc0165c753717ebdea9a03e60779a8da32ab9cb\/ss_9dc0165c753717ebdea9a03e60779a8da32ab9cb.600x338.jpg?t=1789371644","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/9dc0165c753717ebdea9a03e60779a8da32ab9cb\/ss_9dc0165c753717ebdea9a03e60779a8da32ab9cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789371644"}],"movies":[{"id":257352587,"name":"游戏内容","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257352587\/ea655d033042b04d9ad404a49e804d7341de930d\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788791526","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4533490\/1725277592\/0547acf5fea77256dfb52d3858293840d5c8b9af\/1780827811\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1788791526","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4533490\/1725277592\/0547acf5fea77256dfb52d3858293840d5c8b9af\/1780827811\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1788791526","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4533490\/1725277592\/0547acf5fea77256dfb52d3858293840d5c8b9af\/1780827811\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788791526","highlight":true},{"id":257305018,"name":"暗渊崛起-玩法","thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/257305018\/8809135d57c6ae645dc2f9555312050cdc10fba3\/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781181912","dash_av1":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4533490\/105348736\/b512a711e52427de5a4cafb1757d1a12ad2aa4fa\/1780479109\/dash_av1.mpd?t=1781181912","dash_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4533490\/105348736\/b512a711e52427de5a4cafb1757d1a12ad2aa4fa\/1780479109\/dash_h264.mpd?t=1781181912","hls_h264":"https:\/\/video.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_trailers\/4533490\/105348736\/b512a711e52427de5a4cafb1757d1a12ad2aa4fa\/1780479109\/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781181912","highlight":true}],"recommendations":{"total":574},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"Sep 10, 2026"},"support_info":{"url":"","email":"2468412817@qq.com"},"background":"https:\/\/store.akamai.steamstatic.com\/images\/storepagebackground\/app\/4533490?t=1789371644","background_raw":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4533490\/9757ac23dbb208b4cbb16e843bb0cdf55e33dfcf\/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1789371644","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"12","required_age":"12","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem imprópria\nViolência"},"steam_germany":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"12","required_age":"12","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt\nSchimpfwörte"},"igrs":{"rating_generated":"1","rating":"13","required_age":"13","banned":"0","use_age_gate":"0","descriptors":"Penggunaan bahasa\nKekerasan"}}}}}